        },
        "t1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/041_ChatGPT_Image_Aug_7_2026_10_24_09_PM_ddd397a3-ed47-483e-9261-2b87b0f77cc5.png",
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Contained a working breed with zero digging",
            "text": "Everyone warned me a border collie needs a real fence or he’d find a way out, and the quote to fence our whole yard was $6,000. No thanks. Rocky is smart and stubborn but he figured out the boundary in under a week. Best part, no trenching, no wires buried in my lawn, no contractor. I set the shape myself and it wraps around our weird angled yard perfectly. He plays like a maniac right up to the edge and never crosses. Battery easily lasts me four days.",
            "name": "Colleen Ferraro, Erie PA",
            "verified": "Verified Buyer, purchased August 12th 2025"
          }
        },
        "t3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/038_ChatGPT_Image_Aug_7_2026_08_03_11_PM_a9f0addd-2315-4c86-841e-3130bafa9928.png",
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "No more getting dragged down the block",
            "text": "“Every walk with Sunny used to wreck my shoulder. She pulled the entire time and I dreaded taking her out. What sold me was that this is a fence AND a trainer in one. I use the remote on our walks now, a quick vibrate when she lunges and she settles right down. Three weeks in and she walks next to me like a completely different dog. I was quoted $1,500 for group obedience classes and this did more in a month. The remote is simple, my battery goes about four days.”",
            "name": "Janet Collins, Naperville IL",
            "verified": "Verified Buyer, purchased July 29th 2025"
          }
        },
