            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Wish I’d started this when he was a puppy",
            "text": "“My biggest regret is not getting this the day we brought Ziggy home. We let the puppy stage slide and by a year old he thought the whole neighbourhood was his. Started fresh with this collar and even a little late he picked up the boundary in maybe eight days. If you have a young dog, do it now while their habits are still forming. Adjustable modes meant I started with just the beep on the lowest setting. Never had to go higher. He is 100 percent trustworthy in the yard now.”",
